<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left; color: Black; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">Notice Regarding the Status of Repurchase of Shares of Common Stock</P>

<P STYLE="font: 400 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">&nbsp;</P>

